****************************************************************************************************
uird.chain=   - generator of uird.load based on the list of "parent" modules for the specified module.
                Other parameters except the first one will be simply added to uird.load.
                Files with dependency lists should be named stack.order and searched by the mask
                '/var/lib/.*/.*/stack.order$'.
                For example /var/lib/dnf2mod/task-plasma6/stack.order

Examples:
uird.chain=plasma - find module in layer-base containing substring "plasma", write
                    "plasma" to uird.load, as well as all modules specified in found
                    dependencies.

uird.scan=basesys,patches,kmod - find module with substring "basesys" in name, write all dependencies
                    found in the module to uird.load, as well as add basesys, patches, kmod
****************************************************************************************************
